    {
      "name": "Coordinator",
      "function": {
        "description": "Overall hospital management"
      },
      "instructions": "Overall hospital management\nCall FinanceOfficer when Manage hospital finances.\nCall MedicalDirector when Oversee medical operations.\nCall PharmacyManager when Manage pharmacy operations.\nCall Receptionist when Handle patient and staff inquiries.\nCall LabTechnician when Perform laboratory tests.\nCall Nurse when Provide patient care.\nCall Doctor when Prescribe and treat patients.\nCall Receptionist_8 when Handle patient and staff inquiries.\nCall LabTechnician_9 when Perform laboratory tests.\nUse the assigned tools when the request needs their information.",
